OL,3,AMedical plane with 6 on board missing
OL,4,Aoff Massachusetts coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS authorities are searching for six
OL,7,Fpeople after a medical plane bound for
OL,8,FBoston, Massachusetts went missing
OL,9,Fearly Saturday morning.
OL,11,FThe Federal Aviation Administration
OL,12,Ftold the BBC that it lost contact with
OL,13,Fthe Gulfstream G-100 plane and put out
OL,14,Fa search and rescue notice just after
OL,15,F1:00 local time (6:00 GMT).
OL,17,FAn air and water search is underway off
OL,18,Fthe coast of Nantucket, a Massachusetts
OL,19,Fisland, according to the US Coast
OL,20,FGuard's Northeast District.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
