OL,3,AMedical plane with 6 on board missing
OL,4,Aoff Massachusetts coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe plane departed from Bermuda's L.F.
OL,7,FWade International Airport at 23:40
OL,8,Flocal time, according to flight data
OL,9,Ffrom FlightAware, and was slated to
OL,10,Fland at Boston's Logan International at
OL,11,F1:30 EDT (6:30 GMT).
